  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "App Store Connect API version 4.1 provides resources that enable you to automate actions you take in App Store Connect.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "New Features",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "You can now use `build-uploads` to upload and manage build uploads for your apps.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/build-uploads"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now use the `app-tags` resource to review the Apple created app tags for your app and opt out of certain app tags. To learn more, see `https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-app-information/manage-app-tags`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/app-tags",
            "https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/manage-app-information/manage-app-tags"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Background assets has three new webhook event types for background assets, `BACKGROUND_ASSET_VERSION_INTERNAL_BETA_RELEASE_CREATED`, `BACKGROUND_ASSET_VERSION_EXTERNAL_BETA_RELEASE_STATE_UPDATED`, and `BACKGROUND_ASSET_VERSION_APP_STORE_RELEASE_STATE_UPDATED`. To learn more, see `webhook-events`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/webhook-events"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "`webhook-notifications` now includes events for build uploads and build beta details. To learn more see, `configuring-webhook-notifications` and `webhook-events`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/webhook-notifications",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/configuring-webhook-notifications",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/webhook-events"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now use composite or sequential checksum on upload of asset packs. Checksums are not required for upload. For more information about these assets, see `managing-apple-hosted-background-assets`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/managing-apple-hosted-background-assets"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now use the resource `backgroundAssetVersionExternalBetaReleases` to manage asset packs for external betas, and `backgroundAssetVersionAppStoreReleases` to manage asset packs for App store releases. To learn more, see `background-assets`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/background-assets"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You can now read age ratings per territory by using `GET-v1-appInfos-_id_-territoryAgeRatings`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-appInfos-_id_-territoryAgeRatings"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Improvements",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The attribute `platform` is no longer required when using `POST-v1-reviewSubmissions`. You can optionally add the attribute `platform` when using `PATCH-v1-reviewSubmissions-_id_`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-reviewSubmissions",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-reviewSubmissions-_id_"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `streamlinedPurchasingEnabled` has a default value of `true` for the object `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/App/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `APPLE_VISION_PRO` is now documented for `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/Device/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attributes `baDownloadAllowance` and `baMaxInstallSize` are now documented for `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/BuildBundle/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attributes `usesNonExemptEncryption` and `computedMinVisionOsVersion` are now documented for `Attributes-data.dictionary`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/Build/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The filter `buildAudienceType` is now available for `GET-v1-preReleaseVersions`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/GET-v1-preReleaseVersions"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The attribute `masked` is now available for `Attributes-data.dictionary`. This boolean value that returns true if an icon has Liquid Glass treatment applied.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/BuildIcon/Attributes-data.dictionary"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Deprecations",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The attributes for `Attributes-data.dictionary`, `INFREQUENT_OR_MILD` and `FREQUENT_OR_INTENSE` are deprecated. When you `PATCH-v1-ageRatingDeclarations-_id_`, use the values use `INFREQUENT` or `FREQUENT` to update the age rating declarations for your app.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/AgeRatingDeclaration/Attributes-data.dictionary",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-ageRatingDeclarations-_id_"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The `sourceFileChecksum` attribute is deprecated for `PATCH-v1-backgroundAssetUploadFiles-_id_`. Use `sourceFileChecksums` with the new `Checksums` type instead.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-backgroundAssetUploadFiles-_id_",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/Checksums"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Removals",
      "paragraphs": [],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "The `allowedDurations` properties is now removed from `POST-v1-gameCenterChallenges` and `PATCH-v1-gameCenterChallenges-_id_`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/POST-v1-gameCenterChallenges",
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/PATCH-v1-gameCenterChallenges-_id_"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
